{"id":"xxgk-c12020a437971","title":"关于2026-2027-1学期网络课程（公选课、A系列课、美育课）选课及修读的通知（学习考试操作指南有更新，请认真阅读并执行）","date":"2026-06-22","source":"xxgk","source_name":"信息公开","channel":"最新信息公开","url":"https://jwc.scau.edu.cn/2026/0622/c12020a437971/page.htm","summary":"各位同学： 为推动优质教学资源共享，提高自主学习能力， 2026-2027-1 学期学校继续从智慧树及超星尔雅平台选取部分优质课程供学生选读。现将选课的具体事项通知如下： 一、可供修读的网络课程 本学期面向在校本科生在超星尔雅和智慧树平台共开放 16 门网络课程，具体如下表。 请注意，本次所选课程不得与教务系统成绩库已有课程或已选校内线下课程重复（例如：若已…","content_html":"<div class=\"wp_articlecontent\"><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>各位同学：</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>为推动优质教学资源共享，提高自主学习能力，</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>2026-2027-1</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>学期学校继续从智慧树及超星尔雅平台选取部分优质课程供学生选读。现将选课的具体事项通知如下：</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>一、可供修读的网络课程</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>本学期面向在校本科生在超星尔雅和智慧树平台共开放</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>16</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>门网络课程，具体如下表。</span></span></span><span><span><span>请注意，本次所选课程不得与教务系统成绩库已有课程或已选校内线下课程重复（例如：若已选线下课程《电影音乐欣赏》就不得再选同课程名称的网络课程《电影音乐欣赏》，请特别注意）。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://jwc.scau.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/22/6f/7c9c61ef400cbb9615105edf4acc/f3550f78-4bbe-478d-8a40-358277eb62b0.png\"/></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>二、选课方式及时间</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>、选课方式：登录新教务系统</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>-“</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>我的选课”</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>-“</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>自主选课”</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>-“</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>网络课程”。校内教师开设的课程以及《大学生社交礼仪》、《口才与演讲实训教程》限选</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>2000</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>人，其他校外教师开设的课程每门限</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>300</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>人。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>、选课时间：</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>2026</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>26</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>9:00—28</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>23:59</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>（本次网络课程选课不设置除此时间段之外的补选、退选，请务必根据自身情况在此时间段内完成选课、退课操作）</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>三、学习考核方式和时间</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><a name=\"_GoBack\"></a><span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>、学习、考核方式：线上进行（学习前请务必认真阅读相关平台修读操作指南</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>-</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>见附件，具体修读要求请以平台各开课课程相关学习和考核细则为准，并务必保管好自己的学习账号和密码避免泄露）</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>智慧树移动端：知到</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>APP(</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>首次登录请先按相关修读指南绑定认证</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>)</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>超星尔雅平台移动端</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>:</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>学习通</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>APP(</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>首次登录请先绑定认证：我</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>-</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>账号管理</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>-</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>绑定单位</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>-</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>输入</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>UC</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>码</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>413-</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>选择弹出的华南农业大学，输入自己的学号后进行绑定）</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>智慧树电脑端：</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>http://www.zhihuishu.com</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>超星尔雅平台电脑端：</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>http://hnnydx.fanya.chaoxing.com/portal</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><a name=\"OLE_LINK2\"></a><a name=\"OLE_LINK1\"></a><span><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>、学习时间：</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>2026</strong></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>年</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>9</strong></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>月</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>7</strong></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>日</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>00:00——11</strong></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>月</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>15</strong></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>日</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>23:59</strong></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><a name=\"OLE_LINK4\"></a><a name=\"OLE_LINK3\"></a><span><span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>、考核时间：</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>2026</strong></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>年</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>11</strong></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>月</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>16</strong></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>日</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>00:00——11</strong></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>月</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>22</strong></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>日</strong></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><strong>23:59</strong></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>四、成绩和学分认定方式</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>、特别提示：</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>2023</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>级及以前级学生在读期间最多只能申请认定</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>门网络通识选修课程成绩，共计不超过</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>4</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>学分；</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>2024</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>、</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>2025</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>级学生在读期间最多只能申请认定</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>门网络通识选修课程成绩，共计不超过</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>学分。教务系统成绩库已有对应限定门数网络选修课程成绩的同学，将限制本次选课。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>、上述课程均可按照课程类别认定为我校公选课或</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>A</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>系列课、美育课。</span></span></span><span><span><span>如果以往学期有选过但总评成绩未及格的网络通识选修课程，为避免教务系统留下重修标记，在本次选课时请不要再选该同名课程，选课时请特别注意。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>3</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>、</span></span></span><span><span><span>学生选课成功后，若采用刷课、答题软件（插件）或相应服务（如模拟器多设备多</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>IP</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>登录）等非正常学习、考试手段对所选课程进行刷课、答题，此行为极易被不法分子窃取账号密码后发布诈骗信息或植入木马病毒程序，存在极高的安全风险，并且此行为一经发现将取消课程成绩并根据情节轻重给予相应处罚，请勿自误。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>考试时，一旦进入考试界面严禁中途随意退出，因为考试中途退出后系统仍记录考试答题时间，考试时间结束系统会自动提交答卷，为避免不必要的麻烦，</span></span></span><span><span><span>请选择合适的考试时间段和地点以便顺利一次性完成考试，</span></span></span><span><span><span>若考试过程中遇到考试设备故障、闪退等情况请及时反馈网课平台客服或教务人员寻求解决。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>4</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>、</span></span></span><span><span><span><strong>特别提示：</strong></span></span></span><span><span><span>学生通过学习及考核获得成绩将由相应网课平台自动回传教务系统，若总评成绩≥</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>60</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>分，成绩会自动加入教务系统学生成绩库并且计入绩点；若总评成绩＜</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>60</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>分，网课平台会保留学习及考试记录但成绩不加入教务系统学生成绩库并且不计入绩点。成绩一旦入库并达到网络通识选修课入库门数上限，后续学期将相应限制网络通识选修课选课权限，</span></span></span><span><span><span>请同学们选课后认真按要求的时间节点参加学习和考试。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>、为确保后续通识选修课学分毕业审核顺利进行，选课过程中请根据自身所属专业培养方案要求选择相应课程归属（公选课、</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>A</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>系列、美育）的课程。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>、选课中若有问题，请先咨询所在学院教务员，联系方式见下表；若学院无法解决，再由教务员汇总反映给本科生院教学运行科处理。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://jwc.scau.edu.cn/_upload/article/images/22/6f/7c9c61ef400cbb9615105edf4acc/6fee6c89-264e-457c-8ca2-98fce8158f43.png\"/></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>五、学习和考试过程中遇到问题，请联系选课平台客服</span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>超星尔雅客服：</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>电话：</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>400-9020-966</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>，邮箱：</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>tsk@chaoxing.com</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>智慧树客服：</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>通过智慧树平台直接联系平台在线客服，发送“转人工”进入人工客服。</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>本科生院</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>                                   <span><span>2026</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>22</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://jwc.scau.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_pdf.gif\"/><a href=\"https://jwc.scau.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/22/6f/7c9c61ef400cbb9615105edf4acc/03f77223-a5f0-437e-a9fa-6e13a3eb353a.pdf\">26秋冬学生版超星教学平台使用手册.pdf</a></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://jwc.scau.edu.cn/_ueditor/themes/default/images/icon_ppt.gif\"/><a href=\"https://jwc.scau.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/22/6f/7c9c61ef400cbb9615105edf4acc/5379a6cc-9de4-46a6-9c3f-d02cd1900327.pptx\">26秋冬智慧树学生手册更新（可导学用）.pptx</a></span></span></span></p></div>","content_text":"各位同学：\n为推动优质教学资源共享，提高自主学习能力，\n2026-2027-1\n学期学校继续从智慧树及超星尔雅平台选取部分优质课程供学生选读。现将选课的具体事项通知如下：\n一、可供修读的网络课程\n本学期面向在校本科生在超星尔雅和智慧树平台共开放\n16\n门网络课程，具体如下表。\n请注意，本次所选课程不得与教务系统成绩库已有课程或已选校内线下课程重复（例如：若已选线下课程《电影音乐欣赏》就不得再选同课程名称的网络课程《电影音乐欣赏》，请特别注意）。\n二、选课方式及时间\n1\n、选课方式：登录新教务系统\n-“\n我的选课”\n-“\n自主选课”\n-“\n网络课程”。校内教师开设的课程以及《大学生社交礼仪》、《口才与演讲实训教程》限选\n2000\n人，其他校外教师开设的课程每门限\n300\n人。\n2\n、选课时间：\n2026\n年\n6\n月\n26\n日\n9:00—28\n日\n23:59\n（本次网络课程选课不设置除此时间段之外的补选、退选，请务必根据自身情况在此时间段内完成选课、退课操作）\n三、学习考核方式和时间\n1\n、学习、考核方式：线上进行（学习前请务必认真阅读相关平台修读操作指南\n-\n见附件，具体修读要求请以平台各开课课程相关学习和考核细则为准，并务必保管好自己的学习账号和密码避免泄露）\n智慧树移动端：知到\nAPP(\n首次登录请先按相关修读指南绑定认证\n)\n超星尔雅平台移动端\n:\n学习通\nAPP(\n首次登录请先绑定认证：我\n-\n账号管理\n-\n绑定单位\n-\n输入\nUC\n码\n413-\n选择弹出的华南农业大学，输入自己的学号后进行绑定）\n智慧树电脑端：\nhttp://www.zhihuishu.com\n超星尔雅平台电脑端：\nhttp://hnnydx.fanya.chaoxing.com/portal\n2\n、学习时间：\n2026\n年\n9\n月\n7\n日\n00:00——11\n月\n15\n日\n23:59\n3\n、考核时间：\n2026\n年\n11\n月\n16\n日\n00:00——11\n月\n22\n日\n23:59\n四、成绩和学分认定方式\n1\n、特别提示：\n2023\n级及以前级学生在读期间最多只能申请认定\n2\n门网络通识选修课程成绩，共计不超过\n4\n学分；\n2024\n、\n2025\n级学生在读期间最多只能申请认定\n1\n门网络通识选修课程成绩，共计不超过\n2\n学分。教务系统成绩库已有对应限定门数网络选修课程成绩的同学，将限制本次选课。\n2\n、上述课程均可按照课程类别认定为我校公选课或\nA\n系列课、美育课。\n如果以往学期有选过但总评成绩未及格的网络通识选修课程，为避免教务系统留下重修标记，在本次选课时请不要再选该同名课程，选课时请特别注意。\n3\n、\n学生选课成功后，若采用刷课、答题软件（插件）或相应服务（如模拟器多设备多\nIP\n登录）等非正常学习、考试手段对所选课程进行刷课、答题，此行为极易被不法分子窃取账号密码后发布诈骗信息或植入木马病毒程序，存在极高的安全风险，并且此行为一经发现将取消课程成绩并根据情节轻重给予相应处罚，请勿自误。\n考试时，一旦进入考试界面严禁中途随意退出，因为考试中途退出后系统仍记录考试答题时间，考试时间结束系统会自动提交答卷，为避免不必要的麻烦，\n请选择合适的考试时间段和地点以便顺利一次性完成考试，\n若考试过程中遇到考试设备故障、闪退等情况请及时反馈网课平台客服或教务人员寻求解决。\n4\n、\n特别提示：\n学生通过学习及考核获得成绩将由相应网课平台自动回传教务系统，若总评成绩≥\n60\n分，成绩会自动加入教务系统学生成绩库并且计入绩点；若总评成绩＜\n60\n分，网课平台会保留学习及考试记录但成绩不加入教务系统学生成绩库并且不计入绩点。成绩一旦入库并达到网络通识选修课入库门数上限，后续学期将相应限制网络通识选修课选课权限，\n请同学们选课后认真按要求的时间节点参加学习和考试。\n5\n、为确保后续通识选修课学分毕业审核顺利进行，选课过程中请根据自身所属专业培养方案要求选择相应课程归属（公选课、\nA\n系列、美育）的课程。\n6\n、选课中若有问题，请先咨询所在学院教务员，联系方式见下表；若学院无法解决，再由教务员汇总反映给本科生院教学运行科处理。\n五、学习和考试过程中遇到问题，请联系选课平台客服\n超星尔雅客服：\n电话：\n400-9020-966\n，邮箱：\ntsk@chaoxing.com\n。\n智慧树客服：\n通过智慧树平台直接联系平台在线客服，发送“转人工”进入人工客服。\n本科生院\n2026\n年\n6\n月\n22\n日\n26秋冬学生版超星教学平台使用手册.pdf\n26秋冬智慧树学生手册更新（可导学用）.pptx","attachments":[{"name":"26秋冬学生版超星教学平台使用手册.pdf","url":"https://jwc.scau.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/22/6f/7c9c61ef400cbb9615105edf4acc/03f77223-a5f0-437e-a9fa-6e13a3eb353a.pdf"},{"name":"26秋冬智慧树学生手册更新（可导学用）.pptx","url":"https://jwc.scau.edu.cn/_upload/article/files/22/6f/7c9c61ef400cbb9615105edf4acc/5379a6cc-9de4-46a6-9c3f-d02cd1900327.pptx"}],"status":"ok","crawled_at":"2026-11-08T23:12:49+08:00"}